WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.896
Metacognition is thinking about thinking,

00:00:01.896 --> 00:00:06.205
but in practice it is more useful than that short definition sounds.

00:00:06.205 --> 00:00:10.515
It is the ability to notice your own understanding, strategies, assumptions, confidence,

00:00:10.515 --> 00:00:13.388
and errors while you are learning or working.

00:00:13.388 --> 00:00:16.620
It helps you ask whether you really understand something,

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:19.134
whether your current approach fits the task,

00:00:19.134 --> 00:00:22.007
and whether your confidence is supported by evidence.

00:00:22.007 --> 00:00:25.957
Cognition is the mental work itself: reading, remembering, solving, deciding, writing,

00:00:25.957 --> 00:00:27.034
comparing, or troubleshooting.

00:00:27.034 --> 00:00:30.267
Metacognition is the awareness and regulation of that work.

00:00:30.267 --> 00:00:33.140
For example, solving a technical problem is cognition.

00:00:33.140 --> 00:00:37.449
Noticing that your first explanation depends on an untested assumption is metacognition.

00:00:37.449 --> 00:00:39.245
Writing a report is cognition.

00:00:39.245 --> 00:00:44.632
Realizing that the report is clear to you but not to the audience is metacognition.

00:00:44.632 --> 00:00:48.582
Metacognition matters because many important mistakes happen before the final answer.

00:00:48.582 --> 00:00:51.096
A learner may confuse familiarity with mastery.

00:00:51.096 --> 00:00:55.406
An engineer may keep applying the same strategy after evidence stops fitting.

00:00:55.406 --> 00:01:00.074
A leader may make a confident decision while missing uncertainty in the assumptions.

00:01:00.074 --> 00:01:05.102
A writer may produce fluent text without checking whether the claim is actually supported.

00:01:05.102 --> 00:01:07.257
The point is not endless self-analysis.

00:01:07.257 --> 00:01:09.411
Metacognition is a practical operating skill.

00:01:09.411 --> 00:01:12.644
It gives people a way to pause, check, adjust,

00:01:12.644 --> 00:01:15.517
and improve while work is still in motion.

00:01:15.517 --> 00:01:18.749
In learning, technical work, troubleshooting, leadership, writing, and decision-making,

00:01:18.749 --> 00:01:22.340
that ability can prevent small misunderstandings from becoming larger errors.
